{
  "scope": "Cross-event inversion of the low-layer aerosol increment required to close each event's fit-subset brightness residual on top of the production two-layer default (fixed_opac_strat). Calibration lane: every value is relative to the production default baseline and is calibrated, not a physical prior; nothing here enters the default model. Splits, objective, consistency criterion, morphologies and retrieval rules are preregistered in the 'preregistered' block (verbatim module constant, pytest-pinned); the cross-event verdict is the mechanical application of the preregistered bands.",
  "preregistered": {
    "baseline": "every value in this product is relative to the PRODUCTION two-layer default (fixed_opac_strat: AerosolColumn.opac_default()) with zero increment; the committed fixed_opac variant appears only as a monitoring contrast, never as the inversion baseline",
    "fit_holdout_split": {
      "june_2011": {
        "fit": {
          "wavelength_nm": 677.0,
          "readout_count": 10
        },
        "holdout": {
          "wavelength_nm": 503.0,
          "readout_count": 8
        },
        "source": "ROUND2 calibration split reuse (677 fit / 503 withheld)"
      },
      "dec_2011": {
