      "discipline": "layer geometry and spectral law are pinned prior_parameters.json rows (nonnegative Angstrom exponents, direct AerosolProfile); AOD550 is the only free parameter, applied as a unit-AOD column scaled linearly; the main conclusion is carried by the main form only and the sensitivity forms enter the appendix table only"
    },
    "prediction_matrix": "event i re-evaluates its fit-subset median ln residual with event j's (j != i) inverted AOD550 on the main form; the diagonal is the event's own root (approximately zero by construction); the 1990 row is its holdout account",
    "shape_ledger": {
      "june_2011": "503/677 model-over-observed transmission ratios at the paired angles carrying both bands",
      "dec_2011": "450|500 over 750 transmission ratio model-over-observed",
      "hst_2019": "the two committed slope bands, full-window-grid band-median aggregation (same committed aggregation structure)",
      "event_1990_02_09": null,
      "declaration": "the shape axis is a cost ledger, not a fit object; its metrics naturally involve holdout bands and this involvement is declared, not hidden; closure semantics reuse shape_closed_fraction (negative = worsening); the baseline is the production default at zero increment"
    },
    "physical_anchor": {
